This product is a modified fork of openai/codex-plugin-cc
(https://github.com/openai/codex-plugin-cc) at commit
db52e28f4d9ded852ab3942cea316258ae4ef346, licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0.

Modifications: the Codex app-server transport (codex app-server JSON-RPC,
the broker, and the generated TypeScript client) was replaced with a
runner that spawns the Cursor CLI `cursor-agent` in non-interactive ask
mode. The plugin and command namespace were renamed from `codex` to
`cursor`. Codex-only commands and assets were removed: rescue, transfer,
the codex-rescue agent, Claude session transfer, the stop-review gate,
and the gpt-5-4-prompting skill.
